% Bibliography for goodhart-project/paper/main.tex
%
% Provenance: every entry is transcribed from goodhart-project/prereg/citation_verification.csv
% (17 rows, all marked verified=✅, verified_date 2026-10-07/08), then independently
% re-checked on 2026-10-11 against arXiv API / Crossref / OpenAlex by reference_checker
% (14 found, 3 partial, 0 not_found) plus two direct lookups:
%   - arXiv id_list=1606.06565  -> title/authors/published 2016-06-21 confirmed verbatim
%   - Crossref 10.1002/(SICI)1234-981X(199707)5:3<305::AID-EURO184>3.0.CO;2-4
%     -> title/container/year/volume/issue/page/authors confirmed verbatim
%
% KNOWN RESIDUAL DEFECTS (must be disclosed, not silently fixed):
%   (a) zotero_key column is [待填] for all 17 rows (no Zotero access) - tools/reconcile_zotero.py not run.
%   (b) goodhart1975problems is cited as the 1984 Macmillan reprint chapter
%       (DOI 10.1007/978-1-349-17295-5_4, pp. 91-121). The original 1975 conference
%       paper's exact page numbers could not be located. Year is 1984, not 1975.
%       The popular short form "When a measure becomes a target..." is Strathern 1997
%       (paraphrasing Hoskin 1996), NOT Goodhart.
%   (c) Three "three-gap" entries (campbell1979assessing, strathern1997improving,
%       popper1963conjectures) are cited for the measurement/agency/falsifiability
%       laws. The project's own "three cracks" taxonomy has NO external counterpart:
%       the closest work (Manheim & Garrabrant 2018, arXiv:1803.04585) uses FOUR
%       categories (regressional/extremal/causal/adversarial) and does not match.
%       These are therefore citable as the underlying laws but NOT as the source
%       of a three-way split.
%   (d) Year-column convention: `year` holds the publication year; the preprint year
%       (when different) is recorded in `venue`. Three entries are affected:
%       ross2011reduction (2011 AISTATS vs 2010 preprint), sainz2024nlp
%       (2024 Findings vs 2023 preprint), morris2024levels (2024 ICML vs 2023 preprint).

